Passive-only safety guarantee (see SAFETY-POLICY.md):
  This tool transmits ZERO packets onto an in-scope OT network. It performs no
  active probing (no SYN/ICMP/UDP/ARP/LLC), injects no synthetic/malformed/
  replayed packets, and emits no telemetry, secrets, or call-home. Identity
  fields are read only from packets the in-network devices already emitted.

No secrets, credentials, or call-home exist anywhere in this tree.
